# pcre2-only
# W-L3 (span_arms §5.7, L3): the lookbehind's -1 term is the UNION of its branches, so the run is `bc` at -1; a term taken from the first branch claims `abc` at -2 and deletes `xbc`. Also the hybrid prefilter's first ask (l3feat finding: a neutral `landmark_position = search_from` moved the scan past every match)
pattern (?<=ab|b)c
features all
encoding byte
ms 0 "xbc" 2 3
ms 1 "xbc" 2 3
ms 2 "xbc" 2 3
ns 3 "xbc"
ms 0 "abc" 2 3
ms 1 "abc" 2 3
ms 2 "abc" 2 3
ns 3 "abc"
ns 0 "ac"
ns 1 "ac"
ns 2 "ac"
ms 0 "bcbc" 1 2
ms 1 "bcbc" 1 2
ms 2 "bcbc" 3 4
ms 3 "bcbc" 3 4
ns 4 "bcbc"
ns 0 "c"
ns 1 "c"

# pcre2-only
# W-L3 (span_arms §5.7, L3): the lookbehind's -1 term is the UNION of its branches, so the run is `bc` at -1; a term taken from the first branch claims `abc` at -2 and deletes `xbc`. Also the hybrid prefilter's first ask (l3feat finding: a neutral `landmark_position = search_from` moved the scan past every match) [engine vm]
pattern (?<=ab|b)c
features all
encoding byte
engine vm
ms 0 "xbc" 2 3
ms 1 "xbc" 2 3
ms 2 "xbc" 2 3
ns 3 "xbc"
ms 0 "abc" 2 3
ms 1 "abc" 2 3
ms 2 "abc" 2 3
ns 3 "abc"
ns 0 "ac"
ns 1 "ac"
ns 2 "ac"
ms 0 "bcbc" 1 2
ms 1 "bcbc" 1 2
ms 2 "bcbc" 3 4
ms 3 "bcbc" 3 4
ns 4 "bcbc"
ns 0 "c"
ns 1 "c"

# W-L10 (span_arms §5.7, A3, the BACK move): K -2; the body starts at max(startpos, c + 2); rev 1's move (the body at the hit) reports (2,7) from 3, before the start offset
